(7739729, 1276248, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shapes, colors, textures, composition, flow and happenstance.  Well, happenstance aside from it''s obviously being an inner wall of a building cleanly sliced apart.  Going further, it''s crowded with stories, mystery and imagination mingling freely.  Can easily be a wonderful abstract, if some of the reality is sublimated.  Many fine photos in this challenge, and this one stands out for me.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shapes, colors, textures, composition, flow and happenstance.  Well, happenstance aside from it''s obviously being an inner wall of a building cleanly sliced apart.  Going further, it''s crowded with stories, mystery and imagination mingling freely.  Can easily be a wonderful abstract, if some of the reality is sublimated.  Many fine photos in this challenge, and this one stands out for me.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-03-07 23:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739730, 1276393, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exciting in its spareness, yet nicely gifted with a terrific silhouette.  It''s basically water and rock, and rolling surf.  Simple and beautiful. So easy to linger over for a while.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Exciting in its spareness, yet nicely gifted with a terrific silhouette.  It''s basically water and rock, and rolling surf.  Simple and beautiful. So easy to linger over for a while.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2023-03-07 23:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
