(7739744, 1276404, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rollover cut me short, but here goes.  Wonderfully creative and complex, strartlingly powerful.  Electrified trees, yes.  And I''m going to assume that no trees were hurt in the making of this image.  The light leaks are very welcome.  Lovely palette.  It''s kind of like seeing life without the baubles and biases.  What a journey!  Thanks for showing us.<br/>Personal third favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Rollover cut me short, but here goes.  Wonderfully creative and complex, strartlingly powerful.  Electrified trees, yes.  And I''m going to assume that no trees were hurt in the making of this image.  The light leaks are very welcome.  Lovely palette.  It''s kind of like seeing life without the baubles and biases.  What a journey!  Thanks for showing us.Personal third favorite of the challenge.', '2023-03-08 01:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
